<title>AUSTRALIA: RTR-AWA tumbles to sharp half year loss.</title>
<headline>RTR-AWA tumbles to sharp half year loss.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     1.33 vs 3.45</p>
<p>    Net				loss 15.69 vs profit 1.54</p>
<p>    Abnormal			 loss 21.94 vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: AWA Ltd is an electronics and gaming machine manufacturer. The company sold non-core assets to Plessey Corp Ltd during the period for A$17.5 million.  </p>
<p>    Sales				   77.14 vs 164.60</p>
<p>    Other income			  20.82 vs 3.10</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		     loss 7.11 vs profit 0.7</p>
<p>    Dividend				  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax			     credit 4.92 vs charge 1.36</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.19 vs 1.16</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   2.01 vs 4.89</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
